<concept id="ditaot_c_whats_new_in_dita_ot_15" xml:lang="zh">
  <title>DITA Open Toolkit, version 1.5 的新特性</title>
  <shortdesc>新特性，DITA OT</shortdesc>
  <conbody>
    <dl>
      <dlentry>
        <dt>新的通用处理参数</dt>
        <dd>DITA OT 1.5 包含有下面新的 ANT 处理参数：<parml>
            <plentry conref="ditaot_ditabase_conref.dita#reference/args.figurelink.style">
              <pt/>
              <pd/>
            </plentry>
            <plentry conref="ditaot_ditabase_conref.dita#reference/args.tablelink.style">
              <pt/>
              <pd/>
            </plentry>
          </parml></dd>
      </dlentry>
      <dlentry>
        <dt>新的 XHTML 转换参数</dt>
        <dd>DITA OT 1.5 包含有下面新的供 XHTML 转换输出的 ANT 参数：<parml>
            <plentry conref="ditaot_ditabase_conref.dita#reference/args.breadcrumbs">
              <pt/>
              <pd/>
            </plentry>
            <plentry conref="ditaot_ditabase_conref.dita#reference/args.debug">
              <pt/>
              <pd/>
            </plentry>
            <plentry conref="ditaot_ditabase_conref.dita#reference/args.gen.default.meta">
              <pt/>
              <pd/>
            </plentry>
            <plentry conref="ditaot_ditabase_conref.dita#reference/args.gen.task.lbl">
              <pt/>
              <pd/>
            </plentry>
            <plentry conref="ditaot_ditabase_conref.dita#reference/args.hide.parent.link">
              <pt/>
              <pd/>
            </plentry>
            <plentry conref="ditaot_ditabase_conref.dita#reference/args.xhtml.classattr">
              <pt/>
              <pd/>
            </plentry>
          </parml></dd>
      </dlentry>
      <dlentry>
        <dt>New parameters for PDF transformations</dt>
        <dd>DITA OT 1.5 contains the following new parameters for PDF transformations:<parml>
            <plentry conref="ditaot_ditabase_conref.dita#reference/args.bookmark.style">
              <pt/>
              <pd/>
            </plentry>
            <plentry conref="ditaot_ditabase_conref.dita#reference/artworkPrefixUrl">
              <pt/>
              <pd/>
            </plentry>
            <plentry conref="ditaot_ditabase_conref.dita#reference/customization.dir">
              <pt/>
              <pd/>
            </plentry>
            <plentry conref="ditaot_ditabase_conref.dita#reference/disableRelatedLinks">
              <pt/>
              <pd/>
            </plentry>
            <plentry conref="ditaot_ditabase_conref.dita#reference/document.locale">
              <pt/>
            </plentry>
            <plentry conref="ditaot_ditabase_conref.dita#reference/file.protocol.prefix">
              <pt/>
              <pd/>
            </plentry>
            <plentry conref="ditaot_ditabase_conref.dita#reference/pdf.formatter">
              <pt/>
              <pd/>
            </plentry>
          </parml><?Pub Caret?></dd>
      </dlentry>
    </dl>
  </conbody>
